              </?01M05F1PKK714E3Y93TBRZKPD2>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T3.2" name = "恢复真实 session 并验证 mission 归档" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PKK714E3Y93TBRZKPD3>
            记录目标 workspace/session 前态，使用当前源码 eidolon exec 精确恢复并继续归档 add-dotnet-llm-wiki-java-spring-semantic-parsing；验证归档结构、History/effects/prompt/projection。若仍重复，停止放大并写根因分析和改造建议。
            </?01M05F1PKK714E3Y93TBRZKPD3>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T3.2-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKK714E3Y93TBRZKPD4>
              命令明确使用目标 workspace 与 session id，且恢复 actor/session identity 与原 TaskTree
              </?01M05F1PKK714E3Y93TBRZKPD4>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.2-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKK714E3Y93TBRZKPD5>
              执行前后 git/session/mission 状态与 provider-facing evidence 已记录，未 reset/clean 用户改动
              </?01M05F1PKK714E3Y93TBRZKPD5>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.2-AC3" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKK714E3Y93TBRZKPD6>
              mission 成功归档并通过验证，或重复问题被复现后形成证据化根因与改造建议
